---
interface Props {
  serviceBanner?: boolean;
}

const { serviceBanner = false } = Astro.props;
---

<aside class:list={['business-perspective-note', serviceBanner && 'business-perspective-note--service']} aria-label="Business and growth perspective">
  <strong>Business and growth perspective</strong>
  <p>A course, job title or certificate is not automatically scalable. Prefer portable skills, visible proof of work and a route that can eventually serve multiple clients through consulting, a practice, a studio, a product or another business layer. Crowded or rank-gated entry, severe saturation and long ladders where few reach the top do not count as scalability. Keep a second skill route when a choice depends mainly on one employer, one exam or one fixed pay ladder.</p>
</aside>

<style>
  .business-perspective-note{max-width:1050px;margin:1.25rem auto;padding:.9rem 1.1rem;border:1px solid rgba(229,184,74,.42);border-left:4px solid #e5b84a;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(229,184,74,.08);color:rgba(255,255,255,.76);line-height:1.6;font-size:.9rem}
  .business-perspective-note strong{display:block;margin-bottom:.25rem;color:#f5d98c}
  .business-perspective-note p{margin:0}
  .business-perspective-note--service{margin-top:70px}
</style>
